  sources:
  - name: Klimaschutzplaner Export Mainz uebriger Verkehr 2019-2023
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Gruen- und Umweltamt; export from the 
      Klimaschutzplaner tool via the ksp-extract pipeline
    url:
    description: 'Territorial non-road transport final energy for Mainz, 2019-2023:
      local, long-distance and freight rail (electricity and diesel), inland waterway
      shipping (diesel) and aviation (kerosene). Read from the Klimaschutzplaner input
      fields EEV_SPNV_St, EEV_SPNV_D_foss, EEV_SPNV_D_bio, EEV_SPFV_St, EEV_SPFV_Kr,
      EEV_SGV_St, EEV_SGV_Kr, EEV_BiSchi and EEV_Flug. Local-rail diesel is the sum
      of the fossil and biogenic fields, because this dataset has no biodiesel carrier
      for rail; that books roughly 7 percent of it as fossil. Long-distance rail diesel
      and aviation kerosene are genuine reported zeros - the line through Mainz is
      fully electrified and the territory has no commercial airport. The series ends
      in 2023.; Format: .parquet; Licensing: Provided to the city; not public; Geographic
      Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update Frequency: Annual; Date Last Updated:
      2026-08-19; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt Mainz'
  - name: KSP-Export Schienen- und Binnenschifffahrtsverkehr Mainz 2017-2024
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Gruen- und Umweltamt; dedizierte 
      Einzelabfragen im Klimaschutzplaner
    url:
    description: 'Per-mode KSP queries for rail (long-distance/local/freight, VERBRAUCH_Schienenverkehr)
      and inland waterway shipping (VERBRAUCH_Binnenschifffahrt), 2017-2024. Used
      only for the 2024 column; 2019-2023 already matched the existing Klimaschutzplaner-derived
      figures and were left untouched. Quality graded C (0,25), matching the existing
      2019-2023 convention, not the higher grade KSP itself reports for these fields
      (see add_other_transport_2024.py).; Format: xlsx; Licensing: Provided to the
      city; not public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update Frequency:
      Superseded -- single delivery; Date Last Updated: 2026-08-26; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt
      Mainz'
  units:
    Value: MWh/a
    quality: ''
